    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d5">

                <pb facs="0019" n="7" sameAs="frus:frus1944v05/pg7"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">711.00/1926: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                        Minister in Egypt</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Tuck</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1944-06-23T18:00:00-04:00">June 23, 1944—6
                            p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>1575. For the Minister and Landis. War Department states that Commanding General,
                    Persian Gulf Command<anchor n="9" xml:id="d5-f1"/> and Commanding General,
                    United States Army Forces in the Middle East<anchor n="10" xml:id="d5-f2"/> have
                    been instructed to confer with appropriate State Department representatives and
                    to collaborate in implementing policy and procedure regarding Anglo-American
                    relations in Near and Middle East set forth in Department’s 1167, May 17, 10
                    p.m. Navy Department states its representatives throughout area have received
                    similar instructions.</p>
                <p>Repeat to Jidda, Jerusalem, Beirut, Tehran, Kabul, Aden, Addis Ababa. Separate
                    message sent to Baghdad.<anchor n="11" xml:id="d5-f3"/>
                </p>
                <p>Sent to Cairo. Repeated direct to London.<anchor n="12" xml:id="d5-f4"/>
                </p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
